#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:5
#: 1f799ab4530b4f6e9b6147c52267d893
msgid "PX4FLOW Optical Flow Camera Board"
msgstr "PX4FLOW 光流摄像头模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:9
#: cafc3583dad34c3a9fb7f071a4e9e075
msgid ""
"This article describes how to setup the PX4FLOW (Optical Flow) Sensor which "
"can be used for :ref:`Non-GPS navigation <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-"
"page>`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何设置 PX4FLOW（光流）传感器，该传感器可用于 :ref:`无 GPS 导航 <common-non-gps-navigation-"
"landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:16
#: 417d60b5a8b941bb9fb97214f9ce3a34
msgid "The PX4FLOW is not yet supported in Plane or Rover."
msgstr "PX4FLOW 尚不支持 Plane 或 Rover。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:19
#: 6cf49aaa726e4a19af9e58a3133b4bc4
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:21
#: 67e65406c995457c90c854a7e49cbbde
msgid ""
"The PX4FLOW (Optical Flow) Sensor is a specialized high resolution downward "
"pointing camera module and a 3-axis gyro that uses the ground texture and "
"visible features to determine aircraft ground velocity. Although the sensor "
"may be supplied with a built-in Maxbotix LZ-EZ4 sonar to measure height, "
"this has not been reliable enough over a range of surfaces in testing, so "
"its readings are not used. It is recommended to purchase a PX4Flow device "
"without the sonar. Instead a separate :ref:`Range Finder <common-"
"rangefinder-landingpage>` such as the :ref:`LightWare SF10b <common-"
"lightware-sf10-lidar>` should also be attached to the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"PX4FLOW（光流）传感器是一款专用的高分辨率向下摄像头模块，配合三轴陀螺仪，通过识别地面纹理和可见特征来确定飞行器对地速度。虽然该传感器可能附带内置的"
" Maxbotix LZ-EZ4 声呐用于测高，但经测试在各类地面上可靠性不足，因此其读数不被使用。建议购买不带声呐的 PX4Flow "
"设备，并另行配备独立的 :ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`，例如 :ref:`LightWare "
"SF10b <common-lightware-sf10-lidar>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:33
#: 9d8999566bbc4121bce129827ded8d40
msgid ""
"To use this flow sensor you will need to purchase a separate range finder "
"like the :ref:`LightWare SF10b <common-lightware-sf10-lidar>`"
msgstr ""
"使用此光流传感器，需要单独购买一个测距仪，如 :ref:`LightWare SF10b <common-lightware-sf10-lidar>`。"

