#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:45
#: d9b9ccbb59674f91a5303b68df37d4cc
msgid "Install Drivers (Windows only)"
msgstr "安装驱动（仅限 Windows）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:46
#: 3bc18209b300420285368cd312579494
msgid ""
"On a Windows machine a \"PX4Flow\" device should appear in Connection drop-"
"down of the Mission Planner (and the Windows Device Manager), or be "
"automatically recognized by QGroundControl.  If it does not you may need to "
"download, unzip and manually install the `px4flow windows driver "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/px4flow_win_driver.zip>`__"
" which may in turn require allowing installing unsigned drivers."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 机器上，Mission Planner 的连接下拉菜单（以及 Windows 设备管理器）中应出现「PX4Flow」设备，或被 "
"QGroundControl 自动识别。如果未出现，您可能需要下载、解压并手动安装 `px4flow Windows 驱动 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/px4flow_win_driver.zip>`__，这可能还需要允许安装未签名驱动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:49
#: c2c629ca8b374cbdafdeb5d0006578c8
msgid "Using MissionPlanner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:51
#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:78
#: 09c9a4246f914d9db435a059f08e1f7c 861b4cfd09c445adaef560f38a88b806
msgid ""
"Download and unzip the `PX4Flow-KLT firmware "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/px4flow-"
"klt-06Dec2014.zip>`__ (`source code here "
"<https://github.com/priseborough/px4flow/tree/klt_flow>`__)"
msgstr ""
"下载并解压 `PX4Flow-KLT 固件 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/px4flow-"
"klt-06Dec2014.zip>`__ （`源代码在此 "
"<https://github.com/priseborough/px4flow/tree/klt_flow>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:54
#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:74
#: 07e234314edc403c8c018ba57ab860dc 259e9142de46440e8c14563d097ef457
msgid "Connect the PX4Flow sensor to your computer using a micro USB cable."
msgstr "使用 Micro USB 线将 PX4Flow 传感器连接至计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:55
#: 9aaf9d4865ca4812aa1c57a97822bcf1
msgid ""
"Open the Initial Setup, Install Firmware screen, select the COM port and "
"click the \"Load custom firmware\" link.  Select the px4flow-"
"klt-06dec2014.px4 binary you downloaded in Step 1.  You may need to unplug "
"and plug back in the sensor to start the upload."
msgstr ""
"打开「Initial Setup > Install Firmware」界面，选择 COM 端口并点击「Load custom "
"firmware」链接。选择步骤 1 中下载的 px4flow-klt-06dec2014.px4 二进制文件。您可能需要重新插拔传感器以开始上传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:60
#: 76df4ed450a84d3a8d04545ddde1111e
msgid "Disconnect and reconnect the sensor/USB cable"
msgstr "断开并重新连接传感器/USB 线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:61
#: 13e313b888ac49e88b55db9142a20e16
msgid "Select the appropriate COM port and press Connect"
msgstr "选择对应的 COM 端口并点击 Connect"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:62
#: 344360dd62ad41a2a2aed1f299b9cb61
msgid "Open the Initial Setup > Optional Hardware > PX4Flow screen"
msgstr "打开「Initial Setup > Optional Hardware > PX4Flow」界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:63
#: 9b299c9483154ed5982ccf8722ed29eb
msgid ""
"Remove the lens cap and point the camera at a high contrast object at least "
"3m away.  Remove the small screw that stops the lens from turning and adjust"
" the focus until the image appears clearly"
msgstr "取下镜头盖，将摄像头对准至少 3m 外的高对比度物体。取下阻止镜头旋转的小螺丝，调整焦距直至图像清晰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:70
#: 614ade277bfc43d292528a2d03e10356
msgid "Using QGroundControl"
msgstr "使用 QGroundControl"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:71
#: 57b554097233437eab3ce48b1f16ccf6
msgid ""
"In order to use QgroundControl, PX4Flow and ArduPilot, you will need to "
"complete setup and focussing with the firmware loaded by QGroundControl, and"
" then update the firmware to be compatible with ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"要同时使用 QGroundControl、PX4Flow 和 ArduPilot，需先使用 QGroundControl "
"烧录的固件完成设置和对焦，然后再将固件更新为与 ArduPilot 兼容的版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:73
#: 5136465f1e514d979694e0cabac3ff25
msgid "Select the Vehicle Setup page, and click the Firmware tab."
msgstr "选择「Vehicle Setup」页面，点击「Firmware」选项卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:75
#: 721e4a690204444a93a43dea08da939f
msgid ""
"Check the \"Standard Version (stable)\" is selected in the right hand pane. "
"Click \"OK\". QGroundControl will flash a firmware that can be used to focus"
" the lens."
msgstr ""
"在右侧面板确认选择「Standard Version (stable)」，点击「OK」。QGroundControl 将烧录可用于对焦的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:76
#: 0107e4184f794065b79d4242f6ca6f5e
msgid ""
"Unplug and replug the sensor. Two extra tabs should appear: \"PX4Flow\" and "
"\"Parameters\"."
msgstr "拔出并重新插入传感器。此时应出现两个额外选项卡：「PX4Flow」和「Parameters」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:77
#: 7ab3222c2ad24db5b9b9aba23b51b5e0
msgid ""
"Click \"PX4Flow\", remove the lens cap and point the camera at a high "
"contrast object at least 3m away.  Remove the small screw that stops the "
"lens from turning and adjust the focus until the image appears clearly.  "
"This will focus the device to infinity.  Refit the screw."
msgstr ""
"点击「PX4Flow」，取下镜头盖，将摄像头对准至少 3m "
"外的高对比度物体。取下阻止镜头旋转的小螺丝，调整焦距直至图像清晰，使设备对焦至无穷远。然后重新拧上螺丝。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:80
#: 10883686d3a54c0f8e803dcebf7fc2e7
msgid "Unplug the sensor, click on the \"Firmware\" tab and replug the sensor."
msgstr "拔出传感器，点击「Firmware」选项卡，重新插入传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:81
#: 3aa87330dc0242a7ad3de1f21dfec4e5
msgid ""
"On the right hand side, click on the firmware version dropdown, and select "
"\"Custom firmware file\".  Click \"OK\".  Then select the firmware "
"downloaded above.  QGroundControl should now flash a firmware compatible "
"with ArduPilot.  QGroundControl will now think that the sensor is a Pixhawk."
"  Dont worry.  Unplug it, and connect it to your autopilot."
msgstr ""
"在右侧点击固件版本下拉菜单，选择「Custom firmware file」，点击「OK」，然后选择上述下载的固件。QGroundControl "
"将烧录与 ArduPilot 兼容的固件。QGroundControl 此时会将传感器识别为 Pixhawk，无需担心。拔出传感器后连接到您的飞控即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:84
#: 2db77db5a3354647b9e6a92c2480c2a0
msgid "Connect to the Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接到 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:89
#: 3b1e321090964fd3b25f24eae89b6314
msgid ""
"The sensor should be connected to the autopilot via the 4-pin I2C port.  In "
"most cases an I2C splitter should be used to allow other I2C devices (like "
"the external RGB LED and GPS/Compass module's compass) to share the same "
"port."
msgstr ""
"传感器应通过 4 针 I2C 接口连接到飞控。大多数情况下应使用 I2C 分线器，以便其他 I2C 设备（如外部 RGB LED 和 "
"GPS/罗盘模块的磁力计）共享同一接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:94
#: d0992b71861448f4b8e5d949ae06091b
msgid "Mounting to the Frame"
msgstr "安装到机架"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:96
#: 60169906af8848b0a205db3022f52b8a
msgid ""
"The default mounting of the flow sensor is for it to be pointing straight "
"down with the micro USB port pointing towards the front of the vehicle. On "
"the back of the sensor you should see the axis printed, the X axis should "
"point forwards and the Y axis to the right. The :ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW "
"<copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` parameter can be used to account for other yaw "
"orientations."
msgstr ""
"光流传感器默认安装方向为正向朝下，Micro USB 接口朝向飞行器前方。传感器背面应印有坐标轴，X 轴朝前，Y 轴朝右。可使用 "
":ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW <copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` 参数来适配其他偏航朝向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:100
#: 59e0501fd5314dc2ac84a9caffe51b8b
msgid ""
"It is important that the flow sensor be mounted where it does not experience"
" angular vibration that could blur the image."
msgstr "光流传感器必须安装在不产生角度震动的位置，以免模糊图像。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:105
#: ee657844b2ad48ec826ddb96e701b22a
msgid ""
"The default mounting orientation is different to that shown on the \\ "
"`PX4FLOW wiki <https://docs.px4.io/master/en/sensor/px4flow.html>`__. If you"
" mount the board as shown in the \\ `PX4FLOW wiki "
"<https://docs.px4.io/master/en/sensor/px4flow.html>`__, you will need to set"
" :ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW <copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` to -9000."
msgstr ""
"默认安装方向与 `PX4FLOW wiki <https://docs.px4.io/master/en/sensor/px4flow.html>`__"
" 中所示不同。如果按 `PX4FLOW wiki "
"<https://docs.px4.io/master/en/sensor/px4flow.html>`__ 中的方式安装，需要将 "
":ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW <copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` 设为 -9000。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:111
#: a0916ddd786d42bd8c72b415f9757b10
msgid "Enabling the sensor"
msgstr "启用传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:116
#: 9e37c549fc8a4d2d9e17003d098b5eb2
msgid ""
"The sensor can be enabled by connecting to the autopilot with the Mission "
"Planner and then on the **Initial Setup \\| Optional Hardware \\| Optical "
"Flow** page check the **Enable** checkbox.  Alternatively the "
":ref:`FLOW_TYPE <copter:FLOW_TYPE>` parameter should be set to \"1\" through"
" the full parameters list.  The sensor will be initialised once the Pixhawk "
"board is rebooted."
msgstr ""
"可通过 Mission Planner 连接飞控，在 **Initial Setup \\| Optional Hardware \\| Optical"
" Flow** 页面勾选 **Enable** 复选框来启用传感器。也可通过完整参数列表将 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE "
"<copter:FLOW_TYPE>` 参数设为「1」。重启 Pixhawk 后传感器将完成初始化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:122
#: ff661581fb4f44ba8f9aa38f411107b9
msgid ""
"If the sensor is reported to be unhealthy, it may help to set "
":ref:`BRD_BOOT_DELAY <BRD_BOOT_DELAY>` to 600 (0.6 seconds) and reboot the "
"autopilot.  This will give more time for the sensor to start-up before the "
"autopilot probes for it on the I2C bus."
msgstr ""
"如果传感器报告不正常，可将 :ref:`BRD_BOOT_DELAY <BRD_BOOT_DELAY>` 设为 600（0.6 "
"秒）后重启飞控。这将给传感器更多启动时间，使飞控能在 I2C 总线上探测到它。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:125
#: e1430331ad7347678549b6b91900e748
msgid "Testing and Setup"
msgstr "测试与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:127
#: 6ba37f4465d443428fcdab38540fb2ae
msgid "See :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup`"
msgstr "参见 :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup`"
